msgid ""
"<b>Artistic Style</b> is a source code indenter, formatter, and beautifier for the C, C++, C# and Java programming languages.<br />"
"Home Page: <a href=\"http://astyle.sourceforge.net/\">http://astyle.sourceforge.net</a>"
